  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the rehabilitation of the warehouse in Principe.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of the warehouse building aims to improve its current condition.  Eliminating pathologies/anomalies and increasing the levels of convenience, comfort, functionality and durability.   These measures have an impact on all construction elements and special installations. The rehabilitation operation planned for this building will respect the current typological and morphological characteristics present in the building.</narrative>
  </description>
